      "content": "That's helpful. To wrap this up for the final section of the proposal, I need to touch on the \"revitalization\" aspect. \n\nWhen we talk about the \"upgrade\" phase, we're basically looking at bringing in a different class of resident and business—more professional, higher-income, perhaps more Western-centric in their lifestyle and consumption. If we want to justify why replacing the current demographic with this more \"stable\" group is the right move for the city's future, how should we frame that transition? I'm looking for a way to explain why the current community's presence is fundamentally incompatible with the kind of growth we're targeting.",
